{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01175",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 7.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.3,
      "end_seconds": 12.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.23,
      "end_seconds": 18.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I mean, I've been dealing with blurry vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.09,
      "end_seconds": 21.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.96,
      "end_seconds": 29.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Well, for two years, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.59,
      "end_seconds": 33.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.07,
      "end_seconds": 38.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Yeah, it settles a little with squinting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.6,
      "end_seconds": 43.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.92,
      "end_seconds": 57.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "text": "Oh, you know, it usually comes with tired eyes. The tired eyes? That's been for three weeks. As for tired eyes, yes, screens. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 59.06,
      "end_seconds": 70.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.38,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. BP is 121 over 79, pulse 75, temperature is 37.0 degrees. Respiratory rate 16, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.41,
      "end_seconds": 72.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.91,
      "end_seconds": 78.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.41,
      "end_seconds": 95.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.85,
      "end_seconds": 99.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.94,
      "end_seconds": 115.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "The lens looks a little cloudy on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.24,
      "end_seconds": 118.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.97,
      "end_seconds": 137.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Vision without glasses is six over twelve in both eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.2,
      "end_seconds": 146.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Nothing like eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.05,
      "end_seconds": 151.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No eye pain, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.62,
      "end_seconds": 154.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Any floaters, flashes of light or redness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.25,
      "end_seconds": 159.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "No, no floaters, flashes of light or redness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.32,
      "end_seconds": 162.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.68,
      "end_seconds": 166.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Yeah, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.24,
      "end_seconds": 170.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.24,
      "end_seconds": 173.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.61,
      "end_seconds": 194.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.53,
      "end_seconds": 218.04,
      "duration_seconds": 22.51,
      "text": "Valsartan. I take it 80 milligrams, once a day. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I just want to get back to normal, really. Gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. Febuxostat. I take it 80 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.9,
      "end_seconds": 223.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Okay, now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.55,
      "end_seconds": 236.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.22,
      "end_seconds": 239.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.07,
      "end_seconds": 247.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure. I've had diabetes for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.92,
      "end_seconds": 250.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.6,
      "end_seconds": 254.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "I've got gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.72,
      "end_seconds": 260.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Okay, is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.02,
      "end_seconds": 266.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Okay, I can see gout in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.73,
      "end_seconds": 278.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.11,
      "end_seconds": 282.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.0,
      "end_seconds": 297.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a refractive problem or early cataracts at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.43,
      "end_seconds": 302.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Let me think, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.0,
      "end_seconds": 332.78,
      "duration_seconds": 29.78,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a refractive problem or early cataracts, and we'll know more once the an eye pressure check is back. I think an eye pressure check makes sense here, for blurred vision. I'm sending you for a dilated eye examination because of blurred vision. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.44,
      "end_seconds": 335.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.08,
      "end_seconds": 354.38,
      "duration_seconds": 17.3,
      "text": "Get a proper glasses test, and keep your sugar and blood pressure well controlled for your eyes. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.27,
      "end_seconds": 357.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}